ality does the person who is a chef have?**  \n   Chef is in position 1 → nationality = canadian\n\n2. **At what position is the person who is thai?**  \n   Thai is in position 2\n\n3. **What job does the person in position 1 have?**  \n   Position 1 → chef\n\n4. **What is the nationality of the person who likes chess?**  \n   Chess is in position 2 → nationality = thai\n\nSo answers in order:\n\n1. canadian  \n2. 2  \n3. chef  \n4. thai\n\nFinal answer format: <solution>canadian, 2, chef, thai</solution>\n\nFinal answer: <solution>canadian, 2, chef, thai</solution>", "logprobs": [{"token": "We", "logprob": -0.038042102009058}, {"token": " are", "logprob": -0.038165803998708725}, {"token": " given", "logprob": -0.3132633864879608}, {"token": " two", "logprob": -0.9679863452911377}, {"token": " people", "logprob": -0.0006490031373687088}, {"token": " in", "logprob": -0.005553887225687504}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.029764071106910706}, {"token": " line", "logprob": -1.1920922133867862e-06}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.007719565648585558}, {"token": " numbered", "logprob": -0.18541158735752106}, {"token": " ", "logprob": -0.02892352268099785}, {"token": "1", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " (", "logprob": -0.011059297248721123}, {"token": "left", "logprob": -1.1920928244535389e-07}, {"token": ")", "logprob": -0.0052339909598231316}, {"token": " and", "logprob": -0.07888974994421005}, {"token": " ", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "2", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " (", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "right", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": ").", "logprob": -0.03805633261799812}, {"token": " Each", "logprob": -0.25210443139076233}, {"token": " has", "logprob": -0.006715585943311453}, {"token": " unique", "logprob": -0.31853702664375305}, {"token": " values", "logprob": -0.000717025191988796}, {"token": " for", "logprob": -1.9073304429184645e-05}, {"token": ":\n\n", "logprob": -0.3074520230293274}, {"token": "-", "logprob": -4.768370445162873e-07}, {"token": " Hobby", "logprob": -0.10